    "启动、新建和快速记录会直接进入编辑；绘图源文件和图片会保存到此文件夹下的专用目录。首次生成 Markdown 文件后，后续修改会在停止输入约 2 秒后继续自动保存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Startup, new documents, and quick capture open directly in the editor; drawing source files and images are saved in dedicated folders under this directory. After the first Markdown file is created, subsequent changes continue to autosave about 2 seconds after typing stops."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
